  m_Text: "[Economy & Draw System]\n\u2022 Draw cost increases each draw (50\u2192100\u2192150),
    resets next turn\n\u2022 Kill enemies for bounty, paid at turn end\n\u2022 Each
    regiment costs $15 upkeep per turn\n\u2022 Negative treasury = mass desertion!\n\n[Controls]\n\u2022
    Left-click/drag to select your regiments\n\u2022 Right-click to move or charge
    enemy"
